msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"2021 has been a tremendous year for Quarkus and today we officially close "
"our 2021 release season with the last maintenance release of the year:\n"
"2.6.1.Final is available on Maven Central and ready for consumption!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"It is a safe upgrade for anyone already using 2.6 and contains dozens of "
"small bugfixes, tweaks and documentation improvements."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Thank you all for taking the time to report issues, build reproducers... it "
"is immensely helpful and instrumental in making Quarkus better every day."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Have a nice holiday break if you take one, and happy coding/experimenting if "
"you don't, and see you all next year."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not using 2.6 already, please refer to the https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.6[2.6 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.6.1."
"Final[the full changelog of 2.6.1.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
